{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "20fce0e8c446c5639ea079fbb1ad5f86d4e93f72046b21de75b58389713581b5", "ja": "溢れるアドマイヤ", "zh": "溢出的崇拜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ff70a1bc89f94827a3ed64ea8232053ca4e6d86f71f89b056a89ada7f7abae74", "ja": "天体公演と併せて、有名アーティスト\n『ヨルノオルカ』と対談をすることになった\n『レオ』のメンバー達。大ファンのロコは\n驚きつつも、エレナや育と共に、素晴らしい\nステージを見せようと意気込むのだった。", "zh": "在天体公演的同时，“Leo”的成员们\n决定与知名艺术家“夜之虎鲸”进行对谈。\n身为铁杆粉丝的ROCO虽然感到惊讶，\n但还是与艾莲娜、育一起，\n满怀干劲地要展现出一场精彩的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cac4e667a66a0834bbc5b0bf84976deb1cad1ec8412dac05d8d2e0cc57707dd8", "ja": "（今日は、天体公演のミーティング初日。まずは\n『レオ』のメンバー達に、曲を聞いてもらった！）", "zh": "（今天是天体公演的第一次会议。首先让『雷欧』的成员们听了听歌曲！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "38cdee5fd361e8bf21569cff628b2c891602590aa262d2cc3c61af78792ba0e4", "ja": "おおっ、とってもジョイフルな曲ですね！\nオーディエンスも盛り上がってくれそうです♪", "zh": "哦哦，真是一首欢乐十足的歌！\n观众们应该也会跟着嗨起来的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "efbd4aabd1733e47198c708f3c427cbb25a8ef328bd95d62b219cc97592ca6af", "ja": "うん、3人にピッタリの曲だと思うよ。\nただ、歌詞を見てくれたらわかると思うけど……。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得这首歌很适合你们3个人。\n不过，看歌词你们应该就会明白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "30e8e930ba3238496e1285dfe745b5b91497fbcaf2c2ffe1ab4c0568d45e9376", "ja": "この曲、テーマは『失恋』なんだよな。\nそこだけは、ちょっと難易度が高いかなって。", "zh": "这首歌的主题是『失恋』。\n只有这一点，我觉得难度可能有点高。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "e763b3960ddb8179b77c651268fd8674dabddf43f1417c1feeea9eae9e1c6a15", "ja": "えー、それってわたしが子供だから？\nわたし、失恋ソングだってちゃんと歌えるよ！", "zh": "诶——因为我还是小孩子吗？\n我也能好好唱失恋歌曲的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "749891d99640a3cf962701b2460a124a9bc6fbd3952063894ff2a274ec2ad137", "ja": "ワタシも、この歌なら平気だと思うナ～。\n確かに失恋の歌かもだけど、明るくて前向きだし！", "zh": "我也觉得唱这首歌应该没问题～。\n确实算是失恋歌没错，但既明快又积极向上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "12e980567fd6dfb820211011fd5d19a96406213a12aa22f772721748ac1ff689", "ja": "いつもみたいにたくさん楽しみながら、\n歌とダンスをするだけだヨ～♪", "zh": "只要像平时那样开开心心地，\n唱歌跳舞就好啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8674280f16109fc212ceea137215e110df13114567eff6153f07229459a0d9f9", "ja": "そうだな！　ゴメン、余計な心配だったみたいだ。\nじゃ、新曲は任せるとして……もうひとつ話があって。", "zh": "是啊！抱歉，好像是我多余担心了。那，新歌就交给你了……还有一件事要跟你说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "8f26fb99348427402fc412f7d64822a59bd815e7292e3d27b1d375b88b291ce7", "ja": "天体公演の他にも、ミッションがあるんですか？\n楽しみです♪　シェアしてください！", "zh": "除了天体公演，还有其他任务吗？\n好期待♪　请和我分享！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a10d3d27248a78091d5a888b4bdf67648136bd8ae31860ce8adb81db29e4aed2", "ja": "ああ、実は……。", "zh": "嗯，其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "51415a53de04996b22da2ddcee386c8697a99a84297cc91bdb4b681e7f632e6d", "ja": "ええぇぇぇ～っ！？\nあの『ヨルノオルカ』が、ロコ達と対談～～！？！？", "zh": "诶诶诶诶诶～！？\n那个《夜之虎鲸》，居然要和ROCO他们进行对谈～～！？！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "287acdc4258765495ec23adca7aea940fb77ff6bc1bf6bba9e0304e166339a4c", "ja": "おっ？　すごい食いつきだな。\nロコ、知ってるのか？", "zh": "哦？反应真大啊。\nROCO，你知道他吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "af9e552051a3a95ff0915d4e81b0fb857bbea1e98562d168f9d1d7825f21c9a8", "ja": "あ、当たり前ですっ！　というか、\n大ファンです！　ずっと前から知っていますよ！", "zh": "啊，当然了！不如说，\n我可是超级粉丝！很久以前就知道了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "7cc90f25cd304431fb7a8ab528b2f9293dda8f8d23b6580b7b956723d5a803eb", "ja": "『ヨルノオルカ』なら、わたしも知ってるよ？\nお母さんが見てるドラマの歌、歌ってるの！", "zh": "《夜之虎鲸》的话，我也知道哦？\n是在妈妈看的电视剧里唱歌的那首歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "4581db33c06ac3fc5a0c8c8bb5c5096e87f9caef6c34b7184c6636fe1f7dfd6c", "ja": "最近、あっちこっちで名前見るよネ～。\n劇場でもたまに話してるし。", "zh": "最近到处都能看到这个名字呢～。\n在剧场里偶尔也会聊到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "6b18334854b486838b1273fd8781cb0a28659bb27a5393218a30df09dec2e701", "ja": "学校の友達とカラオケに行ったときも、\nみんな歌ってたからネ。すっかり覚えちゃったヨ！", "zh": "和学校的朋友去卡拉OK的时候，\n大家也都在唱呢。我都完全学会啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "82d8f2c3b0467efdeb70e325bec8acc85118afbac6035c45f9a771a8cac8f0f5", "ja": "へえ、ふたりまでか？\n本当に、幅広い層に人気みたいだな。", "zh": "哦，连你们两个人也会唱吗？  \n看来真的很受各个年龄层的人欢迎啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1019_025roc", "source_sha256": "e19fb7078ce4704925f54e454f89b4a391d6f49abed08b6d3708dacae5a1eeed", "ja": "ウェイトです！　確かに『ヨルノオルカ』も\nワンダフルですけど、『Q』を忘れてはいけません。", "zh": "等等！确实《ヨルノオルカ》也很棒，\n但可不能忘了《Q》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6d4a0ea445475e7498318d1b8d6244badfed0244d377e0be015a68baa805a0b7", "ja": "『Q』？　なんだそれは。", "zh": "『Q』？　那是什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "72753187ff085ba27569f880acd244326bc18250a69df1a231d64065860855ca", "ja": "『ヨルノオルカ』の、動画投稿者時代の名前です！\nMVをセルフメイドしていたんですよ。", "zh": "是『ヨルノオルカ』在视频投稿者时期使用的名字！  \nMV也是自己制作的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1022_025roc", "source_sha256": "05fae9f15c992bdc23c676ec23f1487c63896ac13718f7dd65cb7a3b23d1360e", "ja": "作詞作曲に、絵も自分で描いて……その頃から\nアーティストとして、リスペクトしていました。", "zh": "作词作曲，连画画也都是自己来……从那时起，我就一直很尊敬这位艺术家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1023_025roc", "source_sha256": "8ab69b985afe750338b0a4d19ea8c964054f7b03575994f1b979c567560f4e81", "ja": "オンリーワンな世界観をエクスプレッションし続けて、\n人気も少しずつ上がっていったんですよ♪", "zh": "一直用独一无二的世界观进行表达，人气也一点一点地提升了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "0a744e819eb36d38f74f8c76e8d0c2896bb8081999e50a5131f34394a075438a", "ja": "へえ～、動画とうこう者だったんだ……。\nロコちゃん、とってもくわしいんだね！", "zh": "诶～原来你以前是视频投稿者啊……  \nROCO，你真的很了解呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "d8edf3b653013413ff7950dfba5c7ea687dd3df502300f7734f97ff0b4ce0dfb", "ja": "わたし、最近の曲しか知らないから……。\n後でロコちゃんのおすすめの曲、教えてもらっていい？", "zh": "我只知道最近的歌曲……之后能告诉我ROCO推荐的歌曲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "e7bd52fc7f5bea3ad23029141f3ea3f730c01346d2569b982e32d890c345cad1", "ja": "オフコースです♪　アトラクションをまとめて、\nばっちりプレゼンしますね！", "zh": "当然可以♪我会把游乐项目整理好，再好好向你介绍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "c43d515bf1e3d86c52e0b63ec42b063ce6b7fff2b63995fb1577019d955fcec5", "ja": "ワタシもワタシも！　教えてもらって、\nクラスで自慢しちゃオ！　エヘヘっ♪", "zh": "我也要我也要！让我教教大家，然后在班里好好炫耀一番！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "1356a40b045ebd4d69b7698225f3a96ba5c0da4e8fc26c3721d6fa78ae79ba6b", "ja": "でもロコ、よかったネ～！　憧れの人に会えるのって、\nドキドキするでショ？　楽しみだよネ～♪", "zh": "不过ROCO，真是太好了呢～！能见到自己憧憬的人，会让人心跳怦怦跳吧？很期待吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1029_025roc", "source_sha256": "5275f3a3dbd1ef4d9cd21b162294d66793a66e3da1963f39f0e2312b902c32d6", "ja": "た、確かに、ハートビートですけど……！\nロコは同じアーティストですから！", "zh": "确、确实会心跳加速……！  \nROCO和我一样，都是艺术家嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1030_025roc", "source_sha256": "b396b818ddb21376258ab74d82e187164f2b6dd655c1811a3d4726c90bed5f71", "ja": "ファンとしてだけではなく、\n同じパースペクティブでトークしてみせますよ！", "zh": "我不只是作为粉丝，\n还会以相同的视角和你交谈给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1031_p", "source_sha256": "f76570d2360ec0afff093d1f35a174f0b2d80c01797c7e58f091fadd354ba8eb", "ja": "ああ、その調子で頼むよ。\nこれなら、対談企画も心配なさそうだな。", "zh": "啊，就照这个状态来。\n这样一来，对谈企划应该也不用担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "7536634cd5ab5850a898f7c561c7020f28bf0016b0b2c9d613aef017ed2d05ff", "ja": "でも、天体公演のことも忘れないでくれよ？\nそっちも大事な仕事だからな！", "zh": "不过，也别忘了天体公演的事啊？\n那边也是很重要的工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "4a9bbe9beb8bdfd6663ff53f4edc1f269e23e1775db484df08a871885285fdc8", "ja": "もちろんだヨ！　みんなの天体公演も、\nすっごく盛り上がってたもんネ♪", "zh": "当然啦！大家的天体公演，\n也超级热闹的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0253_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0253_story_01_1034_018ele", "source_sha256": "92e34608a7cc56f45814dfc0a35d2d7c46b25c73c77950852229b15022656b6b", "ja": "ワタシたちも、負けてられないヨ～！\n一緒に頑張ろうネ？　ロコ、イク♪", "zh": "我们也不能输哦～！一起加油吧？ROCO，出发♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
